  description: 'During the Main Phase: The turn player can activate this effect;
    excavate cards from the top of your Deck, up to the number of cards your opponent
    controls, and if you do, add 1 of them to your hand, also, after that, place
    any remaining cards and 1 card from your hand on the bottom of the Deck in any
    order. You can only use this effect of "Way Where There''s a Will" once per turn.
    During the End Phase of any turn a player excavated 9 or more cards at once by
    this card''s effect: That player can activate this effect; shuffle all cards
    your opponent controls and in their GY into the Deck.'
